name: GitHub 开发者服务
desc: 将 GitHub 下载、静态资源和相关服务转发至「⚡ 自動選優」。
author: HJ
category: HJ Stash
rule-providers:
  hj-40-developer-domain-1:
    type: inline
    behavior: domain
    payload:
    - +.github-releases.githubusercontent.com
    - +.github.com
    - +.githubusercontent.com
    - +.githubassets.com
    - +.github.io
    - +.github.dev
    - +.githubapp.com
rules:
- RULE-SET,hj-40-developer-domain-1,⚡ 自動選優
